Everything below was copied from upstream at that commit and then renamed by
tools/oracle/names.py: upstream's `aidlc` is Focus's `focus`, in file names
and in file contents. Nothing else was changed.

core/       The authored Markdown the stage-graph compile reads: stage, agent,
            sensor, scope and method files, from upstream's core/.
golden/     stage-graph.json and scope-grid.json as upstream's own packager
            compiled them for each harness (bun scripts/package.ts), from
            dist/<harness>/<harness dir>/tools/data/.
installed/  The part of an installed Claude Code project the graph verbs read
            or write, from dist/claude/.

Refresh all three with tools/oracle/refresh.sh <upstream checkout>.
